%% AstraNotes - Activity Diagram (FR-07 keyword search)
%% Decrypt-then-match loop. Notes that fail to decrypt are skipped with an
%% error logged. Empty collection short-circuits to empty result.

flowchart TD
    Start([User invokes 'search' with keyword from CLI]) --> Lower[Lowercase the keyword]
    Lower --> Load[NoteRepository.list_all returns stored Notes]
    Load --> Empty{Collection empty?}
    Empty -- yes --> ReturnEmpty[Return empty list]
    ReturnEmpty --> End([End])

    Empty -- no --> Loop[For each Note in collection]
    Loop --> Private{is_private?}

    Private -- yes --> TryDecrypt[PrivacyService.decrypt body]
    TryDecrypt --> DecryptOk{Decrypt succeeded?}
    DecryptOk -- no --> LogSkip[Log error, skip this note - SPR-02, FR-07]
    LogSkip --> Continue[Continue with next note]
    DecryptOk -- yes --> SetText[text = lower title + lower decrypted body]

    Private -- no --> SetTextPlain[text = lower title + lower body]

    SetText --> Match{keyword in text?}
    SetTextPlain --> Match
    Match -- yes --> Append[Append Note to matches]
    Match -- no --> Continue
    Append --> Continue

    Continue --> Done{More notes?}
    Done -- yes --> Loop
    Done -- no --> Sort[Sort matches by modified_at desc - FR-08]
    Sort --> ReturnMatches[Return matches]
    ReturnMatches --> End
